### 1️⃣ LOGIN - Récupérer le token
POST http://localhost:8084/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pseudo": "aaa",
  "password": "T@u123456789"
}

###

### 2️⃣ UTILISATEUR CONNECTÉ - Vérifier le token
GET http://localhost:8084/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhbGljZSIsImlhdCI6MTc1NzMwNjI3OCwiZXhwIjoxNzU3MzA5ODc4fQ.0x4LrUbiqYIm5w3IvuKuW4pieGDL4WwXGukEzkKSQW4

###

### 3️⃣ MISE À JOUR DU PROFIL
PUT http://localhost:8084/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pseudo": "alice2",
  "email": "alice2@example.com"
}

###

### 4️⃣ CHANGEMENT DE MOT DE PASSE
PUT http://localhost:8084/api/auth/profile/password
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "T@u123456789",
  "newPassword": "T@u987654321",
  "confirmNewPassword": "T@u987654321"
}

###

### 5️⃣ SUPPRESSION DU COMPTE
DELETE http://localhost:8084/api/auth/alice2
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

